ent-BaseWeaponRifle = 基礎武器：步槍 | BaseWeaponRifle
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponRifleAk = AKMS | AKMS
    .desc = 一款設計源自舊地球、外觀略顯破舊的戰鬥步槍。因其著稱的可靠性與易於製造的設計，深受罪犯、民兵及恐怖分子青睞。使用 .30 口徑步槍彈匣供彈。 | A somewhat battered combat rifle of a design originating from old Earth. Favored by criminals, militias, and terrorists due to its famed reliability and easy-to-manufacture design. Feeds from .30 rifle magazines.
ent-WeaponRifleLecter = 萊克特 | Lecter
    .desc = 一款廣受歡迎的氣動式戰鬥步槍，被納諾特拉森（Nanotrasen）和索爾政府（SolGov）廣泛使用。該槍可進行半自動或全自動射擊，其精準度、制止力及可靠性使其在各類環境中表現卓越。
        使用 .20 口徑步槍彈匣供彈。 | Popular gas-operated combat rifle used heavily by Nanotrasen and SolGov. Operating in semi or fully automatic, its accuracy, stopping power, and reliability make it excel in all manner of environments.
        Feeds from .20 rifle magazines.
ent-WeaponRifleLecterXL8 = XL8 | XL8
    .desc = The Experimental Lecter 8 An unreasonably expensive military grade assault rifle with integrated optic. Uses .20 rifle ammo.
ent-WeaponRifleEstoc = Estoc DMR | Estoc DMR
    .desc = 一款以三發點射模式射擊的指定狙擊步槍。「Estoc」是作為「Lecter」的遠程對應型號而設計，配備延長至 20 英吋的槍管及望遠瞄準鏡。
        使用 .20 口徑步槍彈匣供彈。 | A designated marksman rifle firing in 3-round bursts. The Estoc was designed as the Lecter’s long-range counterpart, equipped with an extended 20-inch barrel and telescopic sight.
        Feeds from .20 rifle magazines.
